# 类型推断引擎输出（engine.py 写入 cwd，可再生）
type_map.json
suggested_types.json
top_causes.json
contradictions.md

# RTTI 重锚定前的过时快照（仅本地留档，禁止误当现役数据）
*.pre_rtti.bak.json

# CTest 运行输出
Testing/

# signals.json is the CANONICAL symbol file — tracked in git (NOT a build artifact).
# Do NOT ignore it: build_signals.py now updates it INCREMENTALLY (preserving the
# completed/done/idempotent flags), so it must persist across clones/branch switches.
